smb: move LZ77 compression into common code

jira KERNEL-1962
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-741.27.1.el9_9
commit-author Namjae Jeon <linkinjeon@kernel.org>
commit 0121b154147f5affd1039ca4f8d9a0fc194142f6
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-741.27.1.el9_9/0121b154.failed

Move the LZ77 codec in cifs.ko to smb/common/ so both the SMB
client and ksmbd can use it.

	Signed-off-by: Namjae Jeon <linkinjeon@kernel.org>
	Signed-off-by: Steve French <stfrench@microsoft.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0121b154147f5affd1039ca4f8d9a0fc194142f6)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

# Conflicts:
#	fs/smb/common/compress/lz77.c
